      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\nanswer_with_context.py - calls a hosted LLM to answer a question using provided context\nextract_json.py - calls a hosted LLM to extract structured JSON from text\nmodel_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Hosted LLM Inference and Model-Family Selection\nmodel_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Hosted LLM Inference and Model-Family Selection\noutput_embedding.py - Embed model outputs for clustering or retrieval\nprompt_safety.py - Check prompts and generated text for unsafe content\nresult_translate.py - Translate generated model output\nspoken_brief.py - Generate a spoken brief from the model output\nstream_completion.py - streams partial output tokens from a hosted LLM\nsummarize_text.py - calls a hosted LLM to summarize long text\n\nCreate model_client.py in the current working directory.\nTask: Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Hosted LLM Inference and Model-Family Selection.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
